==Description==
'''Harrowing Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 34 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|1,190 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|198}} ({{Robux|148}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|19,030 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|2,910}} ({{Robux|2,184}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

'''Harrowing Nametag''' has purple-yellow gradient with a black translucent outline. There is a large, black mist behind it, alongside a moon. Multiple bats come out of it.

